bigmoe — a research project deriving an LLM architecture from
"The big-DC MoE LLM design", a design note by Bjarke Hammersholt Roune,
and testing it on consumer hardware. The note and the linked document
"Designing AI Chip Hardware and Software" are his work, reproduced in
docs/source/ for reference; the hypotheses, specification, code and
measurements here are ours.

